<title>JAPAN: Cosmo Oil shuts 110,000-bpd topper for turnaround.</title>
<headline>Cosmo Oil shuts 110,000-bpd topper for turnaround.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cosmo Oil Co Ltd closed its 110,000 barrel-per-day (bpd) crude distillation unit (CDU) in Chiba, near Tokyo on Monday morning for routine maintenance, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>The unit is scheduled to resume operations on June 22.</p>
<p>Cosmo Oil, which has two toppers at its Chiba plant, has no plans to close the other 130,000 bpd CDU this year.</p>
<p>Details on refining facilities to be affected by the scheduled turnaround at the Chiba plant are as follows:</p>
<p>Facility			 Capacity		Date</p>
<p>			     (barrels per day)</p>
<p>Topper no.1		    110,000		 May 12 - June 22</p>
<p>Catalytic reformer no.1     11,500		 May  9 - June 29</p>
<p>Distillate</p>
<p>  hydrodesulphuriser no.2   26,000		 May 19 - June 21</p>
<p>Distillate</p>
<p>  hydrodesulphuriser no.3   55,000		 May 13 - June 21</p>
<p>Vacuum gas oil</p>
<p>  hydrodesulphuriser	 35,000		  June 14 - July 5</p>
<p>Direct fuel oil</p>
<p>  desulphuriser no.10	 36,000		 May 13 - June 18</p>
<p>Direct fuel oil</p>
<p>  desulphuriser no.20	 36,000		 Oct  1 - Nov 15</p>
<p>Other main refining facilities at the Chiba refinery not</p>
<p>scheduled to undergo maintenance work this year are:</p>
<p>Topper no.2		    130,000</p>
<p>Vacuum distillation unit    60,000</p>
<p>Catalytic reformer no.2     25,000</p>
<p>Distillate</p>
<p>  hydrodesulphuriser no.1     8,000</p>
<p>Distillate</p>
<p>  hydrodesulphuriser no.4    45,000</p>
<p>Fluid catalytic cracker     35,000</p>
<p>Cosmo Oil's other crude distillation units due to undergo</p>
<p>maintenance work this year are:</p>
<p>Refinery			 Capacity		Date</p>
<p>Yokkaichi no.6		 75,000		  Sept 16 - Nov 4</p>
<p>Sakaide			 140,000		  June 13 - Aug 1</p>
<p>Other crude distillation units which will skip maintenance</p>
<p>work this year are:</p>
<p>Yokkaichi no.5		 80,000</p>
<p>Sakai			   110,000</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Energy Desk +81-3-3432-8837</p>
